notes=("Kept all six old kinds (renamed 'X effect' to 'X pedal') and added Octave pedal (sourced). Uni-Vibe placed under Tremolo and vibe. "
 "Dropped old models/ranges: DD-3T now a DD-3 version; Behringer BM-14M, Boss 200 Series/Stompboxes/Waza Craft ranges, Strymon 'Delay', NUX 'Effects' (generic range labels); "
 "Carbon Copy range became an MXR Analog Delay version; CE-2w, BF-3, M290 became versions. Not added: ring modulator (no source fetched), Boss TR-2, Maestro/Mu-Tron Bi-Phase, TC Electronic Hall of Fame (no retrieved page). "
 "Years left blank where sources gave none (Memory Man, Holy Grail, TimeLine, BigSky). Rotary speakers (Leslie) left to the organs shelf.")
